"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "(<<author>>Joe, Wed Sep 04 10:42:22 2013<<date:1378316542>>) You threaten Dee that he'd better answer the current question, or bad things will happen.\n\nDee is [angry].\n\nYou punched Dee already, and he's pissed, but you knows you don't mess.  He should say something angry like, \"You gonna fucking hit me again?\"  You keep pressing him. \n\nDee angrily blusters, then blurts out some NEW INTERESTING INFORMATION (go writer go!).\n\nThis information naturally raises Question Three.  Bigby asks Question Three.  Dee angrily STONEWALLS again, he won't bow to your threats.  \"Go ahead and hit me if you're gonna hit me!\"\n\n(Question Three is something like, \"Why were you investigating Faith?\"  When you crack Dee, you'll learn that Faith is a thief.  She stole something that Dee's client wants.)\n\nBack to freewalk."
