"en": "If you think that will get you results, then fine. Do it your way. So far this corpulent piece of shit has kept his mouth shut about his involvement. When whatever you plan to do fails, I'll be happy to pry it open for you."
},
{
"k": "8487",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We do this the right way."
},
{
"k": "8488",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Crane is right. We don't want people up in arms about mistreatment of prisoners."
},
{
"k": "8489",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Well you clearly don't know me very well."
},
{
"k": "8490",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] I said no violence!"
},
{
"k": "8491",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] As long as we get results. So far this corpulent piece of shit has kept his mouth shut tight. I was just about to pry it open for him."
},
{
"k": "8492",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] I've heard that before."
},
{
"k": "8493",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I'm not kidding, Bluebeard."
},
{
"k": "8494",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Look, this is my investigation. We do things my way."
},
{
"k": "8495",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "As long as I get the answers I need, I don't care how we do it."
},
{
"k": "8496",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] Of course. Everything must stay below the radar, so to speak."
},
{
"k": "8497",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] [cut] That's not what I meant."
},
{
"k": "8498",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] I told you, no violence. We cannot afford a scandal right now, do you understand? [trimmed] If word gets out that you're down here using force to interrogate prisoners…"
},
{
"k": "8499",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[trimmed] Well that's how I am choosing to interpret your frazzled little speech. Violence isn't the issue, as long as we don't get caught."
},
{
"k": "8500",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Right, Bigby?"
},
{
"k": "8501",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] I brought you here to keep things under control!"
},
{
"k": "8502",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We do this"
},
{
"k": "8503",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We can't afford any more trouble."
},
{
"k": "8504",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "No. Violence."
},
{
"k": "8505",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We have to be careful."
},
{
"k": "8506",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Relax. I was joking."
},
{
"k": "8507",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We all know you, Bluebeard."
},
{
"k": "8508",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Oh goodie! I thought you wanted questions, and I was having so much trouble thinking of any good ones."
},
{
"k": "8509",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I want answers, Dee."
},
{
"k": "8510",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{body-sitcuffed}Hello, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "8511",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We know you well enough, Bluebeard."
},
{
"k": "8512",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "When you have as much money as I do, you are doomed to be unsatisfied."
},
{
"k": "8513",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Murderous?"
},
{
"k": "8514",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I hear you cut your vacation short."
},
{
"k": "8515",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Not a problem. This is much more interesting than what I was doing."
},
{
"k": "8516",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "If you want to start throwing around accusations, shall I recount your history?"
},
{
"k": "8517",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Yours is worse."
},
{
"k": "8518",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We're lucky Bluebeard was willing to cut his vacation short."
},
{
"k": "8519",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Calm down. It was a joke."
},
{
"k": "8520",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Go ahead. I've got nothing to hide."
},
{
"k": "8521",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "If anyone's a murderer…"
},
{
"k": "8522",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Stand down, little man."
},
{
"k": "8523",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Will you two shut up?"
},
{
"k": "8524",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Was it?"
},
{
"k": "8525",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Right, you married them first."
},
{
"k": "8526",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I don't have to explain myself to you!"
},
{
"k": "8527",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I know what you think of me, Bigby. But if you imagine you're any better, then it's about time to take a look at yourself and the crimes you've committed. Do you even remember what your total body count was? Do you know the names of all the people you've killed? I was never so ruthless."
},
{
"k": "8528",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Oh, is it?"
},
{
"k": "8529",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I want to see some action."
},
{
"k": "8530",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I didn't end my vacation early so I could \"keep things under control\"."
},
{
"k": "8531",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Careful, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "8532",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "This is your idea of action? You think this is fun?"
},
{
"k": "8533",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You act like this is fun."
},
{
"k": "8534",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "That's just an added bonus. My primary concern is justice, of course. But why not enjoy the process? After all, there is very little left in life to enjoy."
},
{
"k": "8535",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Making this guy talk."
},
{
"k": "8536",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Though I'd settled on, \"How's your head?\""
},
{
"k": "8537",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "And I'm supposed to just believe you?"
},
{
"k": "8538",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{angrya}Do you think this is a joke?"
},
{
"k": "8539",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Look, I didn't kill anyone."
},
{
"k": "8540",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{thinkingb} [cut] You know you're a suspect, {angrya}right?"
},
{
"k": "8541",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{angrya}I hope that means you're willing to cooperate."
},
{
"k": "8542",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{mockinga}I'm glad you have a sense of humor."
},
{
"k": "8543",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{angrya}It's been better, {worrieda}but we're not here to talk {angryb}about me."
},
{
"k": "8544",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You know"
},
{
"k": "8545",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Shh!"
},
{
"k": "8546",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You see what I've been dealing with?!"
},
{
"k": "8547",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You were with me when it happened, dummy."
},
{
"k": "8548",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[slight menace] You may not have killed Snow, but don't pretend that you have nothing to do with this."
},
{
"k": "8549",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Good luck, mate."
},
{
"k": "8550",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I saw him"
},
{
"k": "8551",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] Doesn't mean he's not involved somehow."
},
{
"k": "8552",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "So you better start talking."
},
{
"k": "8553",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Back in the alley you mentioned your employer. Who is it?"
},
{
"k": "8554",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I know you're up to something. What is it?"
},
{
"k": "8555",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You know I saw you at Faith's apartment. What were you doing there?"
},
{
"k": "8556",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Why were you at Toad's place?"
},
{
"k": "8557",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[Trim] [laughs]"
},
{
"k": "8558",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Well she's got air conditioning."
},
{
"k": "8559",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] What do you mean?"
},
{
"k": "8560",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] What do you think it means?"
},
{
"k": "8561",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Oh, you know… Just sittin' around. Havin' a laugh. How 'bout you?"
},
{
"k": "8562",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}Girl's got air conditioning."
},
{
"k": "8563",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed} [Trim] Lookin' for a change of scenery."
},
{
"k": "8564",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[annoyed] Put it away."
},
{
"k": "8565",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Snow White was one of us, and this imbecile knows something about her death. I want to see some action."
},
{
"k": "8566",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You're sick."
},
{
"k": "8567",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "That's pretty cynical."
},
{
"k": "8568",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I know what you mean."
},
{
"k": "8569",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Are you passing judgement on me, Bigby?"
},
{
"k": "8570",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I thought that was pretty clear."
},
{
"k": "8571",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You're one sick fuck."
},
{
"k": "8572",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "That's awfully cynical of you."
},
{
"k": "8573",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Yes, it must be so aggrivating having your freedom stripped away like that. You remember what you were, back in the Homelands. Doesn't it drive you mad to see what you've become?"
},
{
"k": "8574",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "As did I, but you can't deny this place is frighteningly dull compared to the life you once knew."
},
{
"k": "8575",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I chose to come here."
},
{
"k": "8576",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I mean look at me…"
},
{
"k": "8577",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Why shouldn't I be cynical?"
},
{
"k": "8578",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You can buy whatever you want, sure, but it's not enough. You go on these exotic vacations all over the world, trying to experience some excitement for once. But then you get there and everything is just as boring as every other place you've been. Sure, there is a certain novelty to it all, but once that wears off you just feel cheated…angry…"
},
{
"k": "8579",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "So let's you and I bury the hatchet and focus on what's really important here."
},
{
"k": "8580",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "That was all pre-amnesty. I can't be held accountable for what I did back then, and neither can you."
},
{
"k": "8581",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You think you're funny? You filthy little low--"
},
{
"k": "8582",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Now, I told you--"
},
{
"k": "8583",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{worrieda}{Body-SitCuffed}I can barely feel my fingers."
},
{
"k": "8584",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}You mind loosening those?"
},
{
"k": "8585",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] Can't"
},
{
"k": "8586",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] They're too fucking tight."
},
{
"k": "8587",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{confuseda}{Body-SitCuffed}[angry] I can barely feel my fingers."
},
{
"k": "8588",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[angry] You mind loosening those?"
},
{
"k": "8589",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[grumbles] That's better."
},
{
"k": "8590",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[grunts]"
},
{
"k": "8591",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}Real cute, you prick."
},
{
"k": "8592",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}What's that you've got?"
},
{
"k": "8593",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[angry] What're you gonna do with that?"
},
{
"k": "8594",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}Fuck, Bigby. Don't make me look at that."
},
{
"k": "8595",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[angry] I don't want to see that shit!"
},
{
"k": "8596",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{angrya}If you don't tell me who did this, I'll make sure you end up the same way. {angryb}Dead on your doorstep. Got it?"
},
{
"k": "8597",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] I don't want any trouble, but I can't tell you what I don't know."
},
{
"k": "8598",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{confuseda}{Body-SitCuffed}I told you, I didn't kill her, and I don't know who did."
},
{
"k": "8599",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Jesus, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "8600",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] I told you, I didn't kill her!"
},
{
"k": "8601",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "And I don't know who did."
},
{
"k": "8602",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I don't want any trouble, but I can't tell you what I don't fuckin' know."
},
{
"k": "8603",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{angryb}[cut] You can help us catch the fucker who did this."
},
{
"k": "8604",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{thinkingb}This is why we're here. Someone killed this woman, and we need to know who."
},
{
"k": "8605",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{confuseda}{Body-SitCuffed}I get it, I do. But I can't tell you what I don't know."
},
{
"k": "8606",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cut] You're barkin' up the wrong tree, mate."
},
{
"k": "8607",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I don't know who killed her."
},
{
"k": "8608",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "{Body-SitCuffed}[angry] {angrya}I can't tell you what I don't know."
},
{
"k": "8609",
"who": "DEE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angry] You're barking up the wrong tree."
},
